        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=50$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt x&=3\\sqrt2+2\\sqrt2\\\\\\sqrt x&=5\\sqrt2\\\\x&=(5\\sqrt2)^2\\\\x&=50\\end{align*}$$",
