        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=5$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x\\sqrt2&=3\\sqrt2+3(2\\sqrt2)-4\\sqrt2\\\\x\\sqrt2&=5\\sqrt2\\\\x&=\\frac{5\\sqrt2}{\\sqrt2}\\\\x&=5\\end{align*}$$",
